### Health Check Endpoints
# These endpoints typically don't require authentication and are used to verify API availability.

### Health
# Basic health check endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Ready
# Check if the API is ready to accept requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

###

### Live
# Check if the API is alive
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

###

### Details
# Get detailed health information about the API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/details
